  "doc": {
    "description": "03 -- Mux2: a 2-to-1 multiplexer, one bit wide.\n\nO = A when S = 0, B when S = 1.  Classic AND-OR select logic:\n\n    O = (A AND NOT S) OR (B AND S)\n\nDemonstrates fan-out: S drives two gates, and fan-out is free (§6.4).",
